Upload: Sabse upar apni saari PDF files ek saath select karke upload karo.

File Order: Jo list dikhegi, usme files ko drag karke unka sahi sequence (Lec-1, Lec-2) set karo aur blue button dabao.

Filter Cards: Saari slides ke photo dikhenge; faltu ya 'Thank You' page ka checkbox untick kar do, aur chaho toh slides ko aage-piche drag kar lo.

Settings: Niche dropdown se Columns: 2, Rows: 3 ya 4 aur Mode: Vibrant Original Color choose karo.

Download: Sabse niche bade blue button par click karo, 2 second mein premium clear PDF download ho jayegi!
